  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0119_0538a2c3acb0.png\" style=\"width: 358px; height: 94px;\" /></p><p>As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> compound given positive Tollen&#39;s test hence it may consist&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>CHO</mi></math> (aldehyde group)&nbsp;or it can be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCOOH</mi></math></p><p>So for the given option :</p><p>(3)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>CH</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ozonolysis</mi></mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mi>HCOOH</mi><munder><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tollen</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>test</mi></mrow></munder></munder></math></p><p>and for other compounds (options):</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0119_72cb43bb63f4.png\" style=\"width: 602px; height: 213px;\" /></p><p>(3)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Ozonolysis</mi></mover><munder><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>COOH</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>Does</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>not</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>show</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tollen</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>test</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math></p>"
